{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33965","headline":"奉和鲁望新夏东郊闲泛 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望新夏东郊闲泛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水物轻明淡似秋，多情才子倚兰舟。\n碧莎裳下携诗草，黄{𥫗/罒/伐}楼中挂酒篘\n莲叶蘸波初转櫂，鱼儿簇饵未谙钩。\n共君莫问当时事，一点沙禽胜五侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}